mcpfn/README.md:3:McpFn is the Superfunctions layer for building and keeping Model Context Protocol servers regression-free. It uses the official MCP SDK for protocol and transport behavior, then adds validated tools, resources, prompts, task execution, client-mediated features, OAuth resource-server security, MCP Apps contracts, deterministic manifests, compatibility diffs, semantic scenarios, and a safe DataFn adapter.
